English summary

This is a modified, French-language version of PhantomSDR-Plus by SV1BTL.
It ships the Artemis signal database (https://github.com/AresValley/Artemis),
built from the Signal Identification Wiki (https://www.sigidwiki.com); all
credit for that content goes to the SigIDWiki contributors. Redistribution
was kindly allowed by the Artemis team with attribution and links back to
Artemis and SigIDWiki. The HFDL decoder is based on dumphfdl and libacars
by Tomasz Lemiech.
